{
    "title": "Hero Survival IO",
    "description": "Earth in 2201, the most brilliant inventors of the Z organization created a machine that could travel through space and time.\r\nOur main character, Yasuo, is on a mission to join this journey. However, a big explosion happened, and Yasuo, lost in time, arrived in a strange place where dangerous monsters were always waiting. Survival was the ultimate goal.\r\nIn the journey to find his way back home, in addition to surviving before the hordes of aggressive monsters, a horrifying truth is gradually being revealed... this is the future Earth, and he is forced to find a way to save the Earth from this horde of monsters.\r\n\r\nIn Hero Survival IO, Yasuo, an invincible warrior with limitless strength and talent, will have to take up his weapon and fight victoriously in these dangerous wars! Use skills and strategies to destroy dangerous monsters. Overcome the dangers set in each new chapter to become the last survivor. Always upgrade your weapons and skills if you want to survive.\r\n\r\nGame features:\r\n- Killing monsters: Defeat hordes of powerful enemy monsters with weapons and precise movements.\r\n- Powerful skills: Diverse abilities with beautiful images; combining equipment intelligently to upgrade skills; successfully completing levels.\r\n- Simple Play: Clear all chapters, upgrade characters, open weapon chests, and unlock maps with one-hand control!\r\n- New experience: Different stages; different difficulties. All-new experiences await.\r\n\r\nAre you ready to enter the challenging and dangerous battle of survival, defeat monsters, and become the last survivor?\r\n\r\nAll feedback is welcome! We will do our best to make you have a better gaming experience!\r\nContact us: zetylioslegend@gmail.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Earth in 2201, the most brilliant inventors of the Z organization created a machine that could travel through space and time.<br>Our main character, Yasuo, is on a mission to join this journey. However, a big explosion happened, and Yasuo, lost in time, arrived in a strange place where dangerous monsters were always waiting. Survival was the ultimate goal.<br>In the journey to find his way back home, in addition to surviving before the hordes of aggressive monsters, a horrifying truth is gradually being revealed... this is the future Earth, and he is forced to find a way to save the Earth from this horde of monsters.<br><br>In Hero Survival IO, Yasuo, an invincible warrior with limitless strength and talent, will have to take up his weapon and fight victoriously in these dangerous wars! Use skills and strategies to destroy dangerous monsters. Overcome the dangers set in each new chapter to become the last survivor. Always upgrade your weapons and skills if you want to survive.<br><br>Game features:<br>- Killing monsters: Defeat hordes of powerful enemy monsters with weapons and precise movements.<br>- Powerful skills: Diverse abilities with beautiful images; combining equipment intelligently to upgrade skills; successfully completing levels.<br>- Simple Play: Clear all chapters, upgrade characters, open weapon chests, and unlock maps with one-hand control!<br>- New experience: Different stages; different difficulties. All-new experiences await.<br><br>Are you ready to enter the challenging and dangerous battle of survival, defeat monsters, and become the last survivor?<br><br>All feedback is welcome! We will do our best to make you have a better gaming experience!<br>Contact us: zetylioslegend@gmail.com",
